.TH CF-PERMISSIONS 1 "September 2026" "cf-cli v1.1.2" "Cloudflare CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
cf-permissions.1 \- Cloudflare API token permissions required per resource
.PP
Cloudflare API tokens require explicit permission scopes. If a token lacks a required scope, Cloudflare will reject the request with HTTP 403 or Error \fB10000: Authentication error\fR.
.PP
Use this matrix to configure minimum least-privilege tokens at dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens (https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens).
.PP
.PP
.SH PERMISSION SCOPE MAPPING
.PP
.SS "Networking & Domains"
.PP
.RS 2
.TP
