\fIResource Level:\fR Zone | \fIRequired Scope (Read):\fR \fBZone:Read\fR | \fIRequired Scope (Write):\fR \fBZone:Edit\fR
.TP
\fBcf dns\fR
\fIResource Level:\fR Zone | \fIRequired Scope (Read):\fR \fBDNS:Read\fR | \fIRequired Scope (Write):\fR \fBDNS:Edit\fR
.TP
\fBcf lb\fR
\fIResource Level:\fR Account | \fIRequired Scope (Read):\fR \fBLoad Balancing:Read\fR | \fIRequired Scope (Write):\fR \fBLoad Balancing:Edit\fR
