.SH RECOMMENDED TOKEN PRESETS
.PP
.SS "1. "CI/CD Deployment" Token"
.IP \(bu 2
\fBPermissions:\fR
.IP \(bu 2
\fBAccount: Workers Scripts:Edit\fR
.IP \(bu 2
\fBAccount: Cloudflare Pages:Edit\fR
.IP \(bu 2
\fBZone: Purge:Purge\fR
.IP \(bu 2
\fBResource:\fR Specific Zone & Account
.PP
.SS "2. "DNS Automation" Token"
.IP \(bu 2
\fBPermissions:\fR
